     ["电话里看不见人，英语习惯用 this / that 指“这个声音”。I am Mark 在电话里听起来很生硬。"],
     ["中文“我是马克”直译 I am Mark 在当面介绍时可以，打电话要说 This is Mark。问“你是谁？”也不说 Who are you?（很不礼貌）。"],
     [("Hello, this is Sarah from Accounting.", "你好，我是会计部的莎拉。"), ("May I ask who's calling?", "请问您是哪位？"), ("Is Mr. Kim available?", "金先生在吗？")],
     [("Hello, I am Mark from Brightline.", "Hello, this is Mark from Brightline.", "电话里用 This is"), ("Who are you?", "May I ask who's calling?", "问对方是谁要委婉")],
     "电话里：<b>This is … (speaking)</b>；问对方：<b>May I ask who's calling?</b>",
